, "width": 163.2, "height": 201.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 67098, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17.099999999999998, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "盘中 · 执行时刻\n（只执行）\n① checklist 逐条打勾再入场\n② 不看浮盈亏，只看是否符合计划\n③ 连亏 2 笔→强制休息\n④ 不临场改止损/仓位/目标", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0003", "originalText": "盘中 · 执行时刻\n（只执行）\n① checklist 逐条打勾再入场\n② 不看浮盈亏，只看是否符合计划\n③ 连亏 2 笔→强制休息\n④ 不临场改止损/仓位/目标", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 15.389999999999999}, {"id": "e0005", "type": "rectangle", "x": 501.6, "y": 141.20000000000005, "width": 179.2, "height": 217.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ef6c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff8e1", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17161, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e0006", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0006", "type": "text", "x": 509.6, "y": 149.20000000000005, "width": 163.2, "height": 201.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 47474, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17.099999999999998, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "盘后 · 复盘时刻\n（做记录）\n① 记录每笔交易（含心理状态）\n② 统计今天执行率\n③ 只深挖一笔最典型的对/错单", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0005", "originalText": "盘后 · 复盘时刻\n（做记录）\n① 记录每笔交易（含心理状态）\n② 统计今天执行率\n③ 只深挖一笔最典型的对/错单", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 15.389999999999999}, {"id": "e0007", "type": "arrow", "x": 258.4, "y": 250.0, "width": 32.0, "height": 1.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#90a4ae", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 55721, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[258.4, 250.0], [290.4, 250.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "e0008", "type": "arrow", "x": 469.6, "y": 250.0, "width": 32.0, "height": 1.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#90a4ae", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 52913, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[469.6, 250.0], [501.6, 250.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "e0009", "type": "text", "x": -27.549999999999727, "y": 486.8, "width": 815.0999999999995, "height": 28.215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5132, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 20.9, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "决策（计划、复盘）都在冷静时刻做，盘中只剩执行——情绪最易失控的时段被规则框死", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "决策（计划、复盘）都在冷静时刻做，盘中只剩执行——情绪最易失控的时段被规则框死", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 18.81}, {"id": "e0010", "type": "rectangle", "x": 124.0, "y": 544.4, "width": 512.0, "height": 115.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ef5350", "backgroundColor": "#fce4ec", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 35122, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e0011", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0011", "type": "text", "x": 132.0, "y": 552.4, "width": 496.0, "height": 99.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 36378, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18.05, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "边界要物理化：计划写在纸上/文档里（不是脑子里）；盘中不打开新闻和社交软件；复盘用固定模板\n脑子的计划，情绪一上来就删了——边界越硬，情绪越没有操作空间", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0010", "originalText": "边界要物理化：计划写在纸上/文档里（不是脑子里）；盘中不打开新闻和社交软件；复盘用固定模板\n脑子的计划，情绪一上来就删了——边界越硬，情绪越没有操作空间", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 16.245}, {"id": "title000", "type": "text", "x": 60.0, "y": 14, "width": 640.0, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 99991, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "交易流程三时刻：仪式化压缩情绪的操作空间", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "交易流程三时刻：仪式化压缩情绪的操作空间", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 23}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "zoom": {